# Seven of Nine, Tertiary Adjunct: "That Is Irrelevant — {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card. When you discard a nonland
# card this way, put two charge counters on up to one target artifact." Four activations, one per rule the text turns on:
# on turn 3 the card the ability just drew (Opt) is the one discarded - it is drawn first, CR 701.9 - and the reflexive
# ability (CR 603.12) takes one own artifact out of several, refusing Bot2's Island as a non-artifact; on turn 5 a land is
# discarded, so it never triggers; on turn 7 it puts them on Bot2's artifact; on turn 9 the "up to one" target is declined.

